    "source": "Live https://www.goatfundedtrader.com/ read in Chrome on 2026-10-20: pricing widget (2-Step GOAT $5K/$100K/$150K confirmed on screen) and the page's own pricing script (all list prices - identical to 2026-10-11), /affiliate, Trustpilot (20 newest reviews) and Google Maps. Earlier sources listed in git history.",
    "pricing": "standard = list price from the page's pricing script; promo = the price the same script displays: list price minus the site-wide 45% (code GFT45), rounded, except 2-Step GOAT 5K, 2-Step Standard 5K and Instant HERO 5K, which the script fixes at $17. The page's static placeholder text didn't match the script for one size, so confirm prices with a screenshot. A separate 50% code (FIRSTGFT) is for first-time customers. Re-checked 2026-10-20: list prices unchanged and GFT45 (45% off all accounts) still shown, so promo prices stand. Also shown: code FIRST / FIRSTGFT, 50% off a new customer's first account (not applied here), and a limited-time '2-Step' $100K promo account at $99 (list $478, added to the site 2026-10-19) - not listed.",
    "rules_detail": "1-Step: 10% target, 3% daily (accounts bought from 1 Aug 2026), 6% static max loss, 3 profitable days, $3,000 daily profit cap on the funded account. 2-Step GOAT: 8% then 6%, 4% daily, 10% static, 3 profitable days per phase. 2-Step Standard: 10% then 5%, 5% daily, 10% static. Instant GOAT: 3% daily and 6% max (both trailing), 15% consistency, 5 profitable days per payout, 2% floating-loss limit. Instant HERO: 3% / 5% trailing, 15% consistency, 6 profitable days, 1% floating-loss limit, 90% split (100% add-on). Instant Premium: 3% daily, 6% intraday trailing, no consistency rule, 5 profitable days, 80% split. Funded accounts on evaluation models need 4 profitable days per payout for accounts bought from late July 2026.",
    "fee_refund": "Homepage pricing card: 'One-time 100% refundable fee' for challenges; the conditions are not stated. Instant: not stated (null).",
